<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cudgen RZ year net profit up 32.2 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cudgen RZ year net profit up 32.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    24.86 vs 18.13</p>
<p>    Net					6.74 vs 5.11</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Cudgen RZ is a mineral sands miner and owns about 50.1 percent of miner Consolidated Rutile Ltd. After a takeover bid, Cudgen is about 76.7 percent owned by fellow miner RGC Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Sales				   82.78 vs  83.27</p>
<p>    Other income			   2.94 vs   1.98</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   18.4  vs  14.0</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs  nil</p>
<p>    Tax					9.61 vs   6.93</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.83 vs   0.97</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   5.96 vs   5.64</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
